<p>Seeking Greenlights: Yes</p>
<p>Page Type: SCP Article</p>
<p>Genre (Optional): Festive/ Horror</p>
<p>Page Layout (Optional):</p>
<p>Elevator Pitch: The Gnome Tree Is a Classic Christmas tree, but with a twist, Sometimes, there are Animate Small, limbless Scandinavian Christmas Gnomes, such as dolls and ornaments, while outside of the tree, these gnomes are quite mischievous, sometimes when the tree ejects non anomalous Christmas Decorations, and these gnomes will attempt to ‘Decorate’ the containment cell, along with covering up CCTV footage</p>
<p>Central Narrative: These Gnomes Have a Rigid Hierarchy, where each different Gnome does it’s designed task, The Lowest in the hierarchy, The Gnome Guards, can do very simple tasks, as long as there is a group of three or more or them, these Guards are so Basic, that they have been known to accept orders from almost any life form, including humans, making it possible for testing with the object</p>
<p>Hook/Attention-Grabber: The tree is actually a portal to a Subterranean Festively decorated village. Where countless numbers of these gnomes reside, on a Exploration into the village with a D-Class, the live body cam footage shown gnomes never seen before, like the leader of this village, when the D-Class if found, hundreds of Gnomes Gather around him, and then made Syncretized attack, body footage cuts off for only a few disturbing images to be shown, after the footage comes back on, it shows two guard gnomes studying what the camera is, body footage cuts off again only to show A Tied up D-Class carried on his back into a large Factory located on the right side of the village, where gnomes were shown to put materials such as wool and cotton though the one side, and a dozen gnomes come out of the other side, after the D-Class was fully inside of the Factory, on the other side An Entire Army of Lower Hierarchy Gnomes, along with some High Hierarchy Gnomes</p>

