<p>Seeking Greenlights: Yes</p>
<p>Page Type: SCP Article</p>
<p>Genre (Optional): Media/Satire/Surrealism</p>
<p>Elevator Pitch: A ROM hack of Super Mario World in which every Mario and Luigi who ever died form a union, the levels are the offices of major videogame companies and the sites of riots where police brutality occurred.</p>
<p>Central Narrative: Millions of Marios and Luigis live in a union building, where they raise all the Baby Marios lost in Yoshi's Island. Play of the game has been tied to various spinal compression industries in videogame executives which led to the discovery and tracking of the anomalous ROM. In the wake of various Riots, new &quot;Lost Levels&quot; are encountered where the player can jump on the heads of police officers. This leads to the liquidation of an entire police precinct in an undisclosed US city. The Foundation has trained speed-runners in the Media Department who can play through as pacifists to safely explore. A sub-faction, Luigi's For Ethical Treatment of Yoshi's (LFETY), is discovered, and horribly executes Mario's with dual-Yoshi-bisection (similar to horse quartering) who have performed the Yoshi Sacrifice to complete Star Road. The bisected Mario's are still alive, those who have used a Fire Flower can burn themselves to death.</p>
<p>Hook/Attention-Grabber: Everyone's favorite videogame meets political violence.</p>
<p>Additional Notes: Early draft is done, could use more fleshing out but I like the idea of a fairly concise Media SCP that evokes a concept without having to do elaborated logs and progression/reclassification narrative. Someone made a <a href="https://www.romhacking.net/hacks/2790/">Communist Mario 3 ROM</a> with a great image to headline with attribution.</p>

