<p>Hi again Agent Frog. Thanks for clarifying your central narrative. What you've given us is a good exploration log (the MTF raiding the place and never returning). The problem is how do we get to this point (how was the village discovered initially by the Foundation), and what happens after (the Foundation will not allow a missing MTF team to go unanswered).</p>
